8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modals May, Might, Will", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">may </span> and <span class=\"italic\">might </span> to show possibility. They have the same meaning.  <br> You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will </span> to predict the future in a more certain way.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Modals go before a verb in the base form. The verb does not change.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'll leave that wall blank for now. I'll ask the interior designer what she thinks.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I might buy some artwork to add some color to that room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I may hang up my pictures next week.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "If you add some color to that one wall, it may brighten up the entire room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do   something. In that condition, something else will happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If you put them in the den, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I won't be able to see them.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If I ask the teacher to help me, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If he gets his dream job,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" he will be very happy.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "lampshade", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the part of the lamp that covers the light bulb", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The pillows match the lampshade.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about rooms and objects.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "throw pillow", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a decorative pillow you put on a couch ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The throw pillows match the lampshades.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "drape ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "curtain; long pieces of material that cover windows", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The drapes are really cool.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "batik", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fabric that is colored in many colors, common in Asian countries ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I bought those batiks in Turkey.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to decorate", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to make a room look nice by adding furniture and patterns ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love the way you decorated the room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interior designer", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person who helps you decorate a room ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I might get an interior designer to help me decorate this room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "blank", "type": "name"}, {"content": "empty; no pattern or color ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll leave the wall blank for now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "den", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small room in a house used for studying or relaxing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I may put those in the den.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find an old magazine. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Cut out pictures of furniture and other elements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Arrange them on paper as though you are decorating a room.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show your picture to your partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the room.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I create a picture of a room.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe the elements to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We discuss the room.", "type": "text"}]}]}